 "literal": "Easy meaning to become, to reach having spoken, oneself (from) others' mouths subtle meaning perceiving (is) knowledge.",
 "translation": "True knowledge is speaking so clearly that one's meaning easily reaches others, and perceiving the subtle meaning in what others say.",
